 level of  unknown words  because the dialogue is kind of simpler  so these are all the things that we're  working on not only us other people it's  all going in the direction of making  language learning easier than ever  and i repeat if anybody is genuinely  willing to work with us in creating more  many stories point of view stories like  he did something then i did it and then  questions i mean you can see these at  length uh we are very interested because  i think that could help just another 50  60 stories takes us a little closer  another more opportunity to review the  same structures and the same tenses and  the same  preposition usage and so forth  before we launch into the authentic  material  and getting back to the cbc it's  astounding that they're going to spend  16 million dollars and doing something  that from a language learning  perspective essentially is already  available anyway thank you for listening  bye for now

